{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux枚举sudo允许的命令。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Sudo Command Enumeration Detected。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux枚举sudo允许的命令","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux枚举sudo允许的命令\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清主机、网络或权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"28d39238-0c01-420a-b77a-24e5a7378663","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  event.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\") and process.name == \"sudo\" and process.args == \"-l\" and\n  process.args_count == 2 and process.parent.name in (\"bash\", \"dash\", \"sh\", \"tcsh\", \"csh\", \"zsh\", \"ksh\", \"fish\") and\n  not process.args == \"dpkg\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1033","name":"System Owner/User Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1033/"},{"id":"T1069","name":"Permission Groups Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1069/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1069.001","name":"Local Groups","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1069/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1548.003","name":"Sudo and Sudo Caching","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":112,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
